cff-version: 1.2.0
title: samplax
message: >-
  If you use samplax, please cite the paper it was written for
  (preferred-citation) and the papers behind the kernels you use (references).
  The vendored kernels come from the JAX ports listed under references; their
  upstream repositories and papers are credited in NOTICE.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Bolt
    given-names: Maxwell
    affiliation: Purdue University
repository-code: https://github.com/BoltMaxwell/samplax
license: Apache-2.0
version: 0.9.0
date-released: "2026-10-17"
preferred-citation:
  type: unpublished
  title: "A path integral formalism for filtering and smoothing stochastic differential equations"
  authors:
    - family-names: Alberts
      given-names: Alex
    - family-names: Bolt
      given-names: Maxwell
    - family-names: Bilionis
      given-names: Ilias
  year: 2026
  notes: >-
    Alberts and Bolt contributed equally. Preprint; venue to be announced, and
    this entry will be updated when the paper appears.
references:
